{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_FB73FF3C","title":"Floyd Meeting 2","entry":"Dlg_FB73FF3C::entry","exit":"Dlg_FB73FF3C::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_86E93591","articyId":"72057615512927700","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"I wish to apologize. My behavior during our last meeting was... brash.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I wish to apologize. My behavior during our last meeting was... brash.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":300.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29634","byteOffset":19091776,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_13899B35","articyId":"72057615512927761","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"I hear you're becoming a big player in the catering world.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hear you're becoming a big player in the catering world.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49925","byteOffset":33230016,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_2E4B47DD","articyId":"72057615512927782","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"That's what I like to hear. Owning a business isn't easy. We have to fight for our own corner.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's what I like to hear. Owning a business isn't easy. We have to fight for our own corner.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28771","byteOffset":18768216,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_E11BA695","articyId":"72057615512927794","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"Enough of that meat-speak. If we don't hype ourselves, who will?","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Enough of that meat-speak. If we don't hype ourselves, who will?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51613","byteOffset":33942192,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_9B021F0D","articyId":"72057615512927809","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"The Mechatomb is a complicated place. Sure, it's a gym, a safe haven for us mechs to train but it's also a hub, a place in the community for the downtrodden.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Mechatomb is a complicated place. Sure, it's a gym, a safe haven for us mechs to train but it's also a hub, a place in the community for the downtrodden.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21892","byteOffset":16170184,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_12154030","articyId":"72057615512927823","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"Training is not always about physical change. Our strength class is hard-wired but our ability to learn what to do with that is adaptable. It's probably hard for meat to understand.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Training is not always about physical change. Our strength class is hard-wired but our ability to learn what to do with that is adaptable. It's probably hard for meat to understand.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48856","byteOffset":32822696,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_82F4F55C","articyId":"72057615512927837","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"Something you should think about while you grow your empire. You're not just selling noodles, sometimes people need more than that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Something you should think about while you grow your empire. You're not just selling noodles, sometimes people need more than that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45979","byteOffset":31726600,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_B52B7A1D","articyId":"72057615512927885","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"For example, I'm currently dealing with a disgruntled customer who might well get himself into trouble. Refused to train in the correct way. If he gets hurt now, I have to live with that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For example, I'm currently dealing with a disgruntled customer who might well get himself into trouble. Refused to train in the correct way. If he gets hurt now, I have to live with that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4475.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37808","byteOffset":28639216,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_16B5DADA","articyId":"72057615512927899","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Floyd","text":"And they say I'm the robot...","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And they say I'm the robot...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5050.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19682","byteOffset":15329552,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_E297E76E","articyId":"72057615512927707","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No problem.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No problem.","TextSheVersion":"No problem.","TextTheyVersion":"No problem."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":600.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46417","byteOffset":31894936,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_D0D93F64","articyId":"72057615512927768","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You heard right.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You heard right.","TextSheVersion":"You heard right.","TextTheyVersion":"You heard right."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50358","byteOffset":33392416,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_17CD4EDA","articyId":"72057615512927774","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'd hardly say I'm a big player.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'd hardly say I'm a big player.","TextSheVersion":"I'd hardly say I'm a big player.","TextTheyVersion":"I'd hardly say I'm a big player."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49743","byteOffset":33161248,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_5DE98AB7","articyId":"72057615512927801","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're right. How's your gym doing?","spea